Third-party files include their own licenses. The Windows binary includes
FFmpeg 7.1.3 and embeds a DirectShow filter using libdshowcapture. Both
libraries are used under LGPL 2.1 or later. The corresponding sources and
complete build scripts below allow modifying and relinking them. The
libdshowcapture subset is based on commit
c13d4b7b0c66979396ba0a9060c9aafc15bb7b22 of obsproject/libdshowcapture, with
local changes for MinGW and the RelayCam capture modes. See src/windows/COPYING
and FFmpeg-LGPL.txt.
